# img-gen — bugs & improvement plan

## critical bugs (js errors — page broken)

1.  line 159 — `apiKey:*** model:"dall-e-3"`
    missing comma + corrupted value. should be:
    `apiKey:"", model:"dall-e-3"`
    → causes SyntaxError, entire script dies

2.  line 176 — `$( ("model")`
    double opening paren — should be `$("model")`
    → causes SyntaxError on model chip init

## functional issues (features exist but don't work)

3.  resolution tier (resTier) does nothing
    — saved to localStorage but never used to set size
    — need: map 1k→1024, 2k→2048, 4k→4096 when generating

4.  style preset "none" appends empty string → `", "` added to prompt
    — need: skip if value is empty string

5.  ratio chips don't save to config presets
    — ratio is in FIELDS but not in the preset save/load flow

6.  config presets don't include stylePreset or ratio state
    — only FIELDS are saved, localStorage keys like imgen_stylePreset are not

7.  reference image state lost on page reload
    — refB64 is a js variable, not recovered from localStorage

## improvements (quality of life)

8.  empty gallery state — show "no images yet" placeholder
9.  gallery clear button — remove all images
10. prompt/neg not saved to config presets (only autosaved per-field)
11. no copy-to-clipboard for generated image URLs
12. keyboard shortcut ctrl+s to save config
13. generate button should show spinner while loading
14. model chips: add "custom" chip that focuses the model input
15. file size validation for reference image (>10MB warn)
16. server: add health endpoint /api/health

## phase order

p0 (fix right now)  → lines 159, 176 syntax errors
p1 (functional)    → 3, 4, 5, 6, 7
p2 (polish)        → 8-16
